      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Renna Holt follows Mirelle Voss up the rising aisle with the bronze lantern\nheld high, its blue flame burning low. At the dry stair, Mirelle keeps the\nrescued scavenger above the water and says, “One step at a time. Renna,\ntake the lantern to that beacon; I’ll keep them above the water.”"
    },
    {
      "count": 3,
      "filename": "page-002.png",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "e73dc3d3dba43368a7fef53b8b1dbbf672fa0d7cbd5e514715fd045277c735d2",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Renna climbs to the unlit bronze beacon, finds the covered socket in its\nbase, and fits the lantern into it as damp air crosses the landing. “Mirelle,\nI’m setting it in.” Bronze clicks; blue fire races through the beacon and\nflares over the flooded archives."
    },
